        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Community Counts: Aska's Animals</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/50069.webp" alt="Community Counts: Aska's Animals" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>Throughout the pandemic, people acquired new pets and some people are feeling at a loss for what to do with their now 10-month-old large puppy who is barking constantly.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://askasanimals.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Aska’s Animals</a> will provide a progressive environment to provide people and pets of Teton Valley with the tools needed to be happy in their homes.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<p>Whether this is through behavior consultations, adoption, volunteer opportunities or providing sanctuary to homeless pigs in our region, we believe that all animals deserve a happy home to thrive in.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<p>We like to dream big and one day soon we would love to have an in-house certified dog trainer who uses science-based methods to work with resident dogs as well as dogs that have been recently adopted through us or our partnering shelters.&nbsp;</p>

<p>For now, we are shouting from the rooftops that we are officially a nonprofit and we are looking forward to kicking off with Tin Cup 2021.&nbsp;</p>

